      "content": "<h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Introduction:&nbsp;</b></span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Located in the densely populated southeast region of Bengaluru, Sarjapur is a rapidly developing residential and commercial area with the advantage of urban living that is complemented with ease of access at a strategic location. It has transitioned from being a peaceful town of Anekal taluk to a highly desirable destination as it lies close to prominent IT clusters like Whitefield, Electronic City, and Marathahalli. With the finest schools, malls, and entertainment zones,&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur offers a modern lifestyle without compromising on a healthy suburban charm. Its established infrastructure and ongoing realty boom make it the first preference among professionals and families. Whether a vibrant community or convenient connectivity to Bangalore's IT corridors, Sarjapur has it all—discover why this locality is the next big thing!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6c5d3363-7fff-7d23-45bd-4941bf8e2945\"></span></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Connectivity in Sarjapur -&nbsp; Distance, Metro, BTMC Buses</b></span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br></b></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-de5a2da3-7fff-2c61-f245-c2977864fb21\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Distance from Key Areas:</span></span></span></h3><h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></h3><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-04899079-7fff-9271-31c2-2080de87209f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Destination</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-648677bd-7fff-ad41-2494-eee5a75304b3\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Distance</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2577ff78-7fff-dbc9-e583-7438390333d5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Travel Time (approx.)</b></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3a1c1bb8-7fff-0433-8ff4-334a79f9e7eb\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Route</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-23b41cd7-7fff-2763-8b13-c29f3fc1735b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Whitefield</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d06ff263-7fff-d84f-2229-05f588a72779\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">17 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1b60d79f-7fff-8014-4df3-1bacbdc5ea6f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">35-45 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-be8305ca-7fff-2713-ea7c-f8105182ac97\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Via SH 35 and Varthur - Sarjapur Rd</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f99532df-7fff-3e8e-8ab7-e4191590ddd8\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Electronic City</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-001b9b95-7fff-f0d5-0b5c-d572f6fc2970\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">27 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a57d4809-7fff-963e-87cd-a159292458dc\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">40-60 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bff430a0-7fff-42a1-d1b0-e3f08d6121d3\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">NH 44/NH 48 and NH 948A</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-92913c34-7fff-5740-0a9c-93e61ae99ad5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Koramangala</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6bc8193f-7fff-061a-7768-f4fb82923b12\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">22 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6062cce5-7fff-b0a8-c195-fbe3a7ddd4be\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">60 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1d39f3ee-7fff-5f63-c34a-72da9f329ce7\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur - Marathahalli Rd</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8fa8d708-7fff-70ed-4bca-af08cd4dedd5\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Silk Board Junction</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-23cb350b-7fff-1eaa-1479-b4dbadadc182\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">22 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-46e5236d-7fff-d693-7b47-604a49f8fe58\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">60 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b6ecbf54-7fff-78dd-dfce-e555192cfb46\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">via Ambalipura - Sarjapur Rd/Sarjapur - Marathahalli Rd</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-164ec40b-7fff-9087-bd1f-76de3ca34e3d\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">MG Road</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-dec4bb87-7fff-44e0-01a6-b58d03ca280b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">28 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-feb44989-7fff-f01e-fd30-5554610a2fed\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">80 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e2f276b4-7fff-9035-f231-5f28a9bd94ea\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">via Sarjapur - Marathahalli Rd</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6e14728c-7fff-b8b1-4d81-1f06a9bbb105\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Kempegowda International Airport</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f9de0bdb-7fff-616a-288e-395b3cac8a0b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">54 km</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f1d5fae8-7fff-06f7-013c-7e9dc5b77732\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">120 mins</span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a2e09255-7fff-ac75-7c1c-5869d3735d11\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">SH 35</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">This will offer quick, hassle-free commute to IT hubs, malls, and residential areas, making Sarjapur Road a very coveted destination.</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\"><b>Note:&nbsp;</b><span data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"342\" style=\"\">Looking for the best <a href=\"https://www.pr7-articles.com/Articles-of-2024/your-complete-guide-finding-right-home-sarjapur-road-bangalore\" target=\"_blank\">apartments in Sarjapur Road</a> but don’t know where to start?</span> Read this complete guide to find your ideal home in one of Bangalore’s most sought-after localities</p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">BMTC Bus Connectivity in Sarjapur Road:&nbsp;</h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">Sarjapur Road has good bus connectivity across Bengaluru, though it requires betterment to reach IT corridors and Outer Ring Road more effectively. While BMTC services are regular and connect major transit points, the absence of direct routes to major employment centers is a concern.</p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">BMTC Routes:</h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">1) 340 Series (340, 341E, 342V, 342Z) - Connects to K.R. Market and central Bengaluru<br>2) 500 Series (500CF, 500CH, 500EB) - Links to Majestic and Tin Factory (tech corridor)</p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">New Route Initiatives:</h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">New additions such as 500CH and 500EB routes actually cater to connectivity to the tech corridor, connecting Sarjapur Road further with working locations such as Tin Factory.</p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">Major Bus Transfer Points:</h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">1) Sarjapur Junction (primary transit hub)<br>2) Carmelaram Bus Stop<br>3) Wipro Corporate Office stop</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;\">There are existing BMTC services which supply the necessary connectivity, but introducing additional direct routes to ORR and IT parks would make a huge difference to commuter efficiency for Sarjapur Road users.</p><div><h2><b>Social Infrastructure in Sarjapur:&nbsp;</b></h2><div><br></div><div>Once a sleepy suburban belt, <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/is-living-on-sarjapur-road-a-good-choice\" target=\"_blank\">Sarjapur Road</a> has transformed into one of Bangalore's most vibrant corridors. The region now has wider roads, new flyovers, and future metro connectivity—radically reducing commute times. Mega residential complexes, IT parks, shopping malls, and high-end schools have transformed its landscape, rendering it a self-contained micro-city.</div><div><br></div><div>The soon-to-be-developed Hebbal-Sarjapur Metro (Red line) and Peripheral Ring Road (PRR) guarantee easy access to key nodes like Koramangala and Bellandur. Graced with quality hospitals, commercial spaces, and entertainment zones, Sarjapur Road enjoys urban convenience and suburban tranquility in its perfect proportion—a paradise for professionals and families alike. The future looks even brighter with proposals for infrastructure development to decongest and drive growth.</div><div><br></div><h3>Educational Institutions in Sarjapur:</h3><p><br></p></div><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><b>Schools</b></td><td>Sri Ram Public School, St. Philomena's English School, One World International School, Harvest International School, Orchids The International School&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Colleges</b></td><td>St Jeromes PU and Degree College, Siri Shrine PU College</td></tr></tbody></table><div><p><br></p><h3>Lifestyle and Entertainment in Sarjapur:&nbsp;</h3><p><br></p></div><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><b>Malls</b></td><td><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Centro mall&nbsp;</span><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Cafes</b></td><td><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Third Wave Coffee, Zoey's: Good Vibes Only, Mud Cups Cafe, The Dome Cafe, Therpup Cafe</span><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Pubs</b></td><td>Big Pitcher, Waves Bar &amp; Kitchen, The Bier Library Brewery &amp; Kitchen, Byg Brewski Brewing Company, Sarjapur Social<br><br></td></tr></tbody></table><div><h3>Emergency Services in Sarjapur:&nbsp;</h3><p><br></p></div><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><b>Hospitals</b></td><td>Spandana Heart &amp; Super Speciality Hospital, Belenus Champion Hospital, Manipal Hospital , Motherhood Hospital</td></tr><tr><td><b>Police station</b></td><td>Sarjapura Police Station</td></tr><tr><td><b>Fire station</b></td><td>Sarjapur Road Fire Station</td></tr></tbody></table><div><p><br></p><h2>Employment Hubs in Sarjapur:&nbsp;</h2><p><br></p><p>Sarjapur Road has become a hot spot for corporate and tech expansion with huge IT parks such as RGA Tech Park, Wipro Technology Campus, Global Technology Park, Vaishnavi Tech Park. Its locational advantage provides easy access to Whitefield, Electronic City, and the thriving ORR tech belt, making it popular among professionals.</p><p>With giants such as Wipro Technologies, Infosys, Accenture, HCL Technologies, Tech Mahindra and the areas around it, the locality hums with possibility and innovation. Outside of work, Sarjapur Road is an urban vibrancy with great cafes, shopping zones, and smooth transit connectivity—perfect for professionals looking for work-life ease. The future? Brighter still with upcoming metro extensions and infrastructure development!.</p><p><br></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3c46a306-7fff-7768-7caa-5c752ad97a28\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Note:</b>&nbsp;</span></span>Confused between choosing <a href=\"https://ext-6790324.livejournal.com/688.html\" target=\"_blank\">furnished vs unfurnished 2 BHK apartments for rent</a>? Read this comparison guide to make the smarter decision based on your needs and budget.</p><p><br></p><h2><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3c46a306-7fff-7768-7caa-5c752ad97a28\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Average rent in Sarjapur:</span></span></h2><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3c46a306-7fff-7768-7caa-5c752ad97a28\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 746px;\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2d9039b9-7fff-7ac9-2f0f-d95e58a8ecf1\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Property Type</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6525774a-7fff-9b27-1011-8bf61a53b50c\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Price Range (₹)</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d93cf27b-7fff-c910-3de0-99fb11704470\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Average Price (₹)</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-adb26341-7fff-e564-5cd0-511e799c74fd\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Typical Size (Sq.ft)</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-34d2580b-7fff-008b-88d6-e3fe9d52702c\">1 BHK</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-a9b6f30b-7fff-8449-94a6-9fdb65bcb1dd\">14,000 - 21,000</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d3f97c27-7fff-fcf0-4ca9-c56f95d7e41d\">17,500</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4cf841d1-7fff-675b-56fa-93218b07ca1e\">500-700</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d760121a-7fff-1a06-3ac7-33a2229df6db\">2 BHK</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f30cfad2-7fff-a8de-528a-ef469f54d22c\">20,000 - 45,000</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-496904bd-7fff-1952-f13b-8f62da34b275\">32,500</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-75fa39ec-7fff-8611-299c-18bea33281c4\">900-1,300</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6e6fa87a-7fff-3287-5e15-8415972877d4\">3 BHK</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9f0b777d-7fff-c418-7b04-6438f9272410\">40,000 - 80,000</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-2dea4526-7fff-30ad-9737-b08d9640f4b1\">60,000</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-def5c9f7-7fff-a36a-e32a-e26d7a1839a6\">1,500-2,200</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b92b346d-7fff-4fba-2fc2-6931e6cb243b\">Luxury 3BHK+</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-84c59e89-7fff-df8d-3cdf-46c6409e5ed8\">75,000 - 1.2L+</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-53de85d0-7fff-464d-ed8d-778224088b7b\">90,000</span></p></td><td><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-35c177d0-7fff-c1a9-3cf1-d06db4162ee0\">2,000-3,500</span></p><div><span><br></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><br></p><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000001191028\" data-doc-type=\"writer\" style=\"box-sizing: revert; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: revert;\"><b>Note:</b></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: revert; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;Looking for a&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur\" style=\"box-sizing: revert;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: revert; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">2 BHK for rent in Sarjapur Road</span></a><span style=\"box-sizing: revert; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">? Whether you're a working professional or a family, this fast-growing area offers great connectivity, amenities, and value for money.</span></p><p><span style=\"box-sizing: revert; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><h2><b>Conclusion:&nbsp;</b></h2><p><br></p><p>Sarjapur Road has transitioned seamlessly from a sleepy suburb to one of Bengaluru's most potential micro-markets. With world-class IT parks, class-leading schools, world-class healthcare, and lively lifestyle enclaves, it offers the urban convenience and peace of the suburb. The Hebbal-Sarjapur Metro (Red Line) and Peripheral Ring Road will further enhance its connectivity, making travel easy and growth inevitable.</p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3c46a306-7fff-7768-7caa-5c752ad97a28\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p>Be it a corporate professional seeking the advantage of proximity to the tech belt, a family seeking education and safety, or an investor seeking to gain high returns, Sarjapur Road has it all. With connectivity to highways enhanced and demand increasing, invest, reside, or work today in this successful belt—a tomorrow that Bangalore is being constructed here.</p></div>",
